## Resolved Open Questions

| Question | Decision | Rationale |
|----------|----------|-----------|
| **Payment Gateway** | ✅ Real Razorpay test keys for both appointments AND product purchases | User confirmed |
| **Push Notifications** | ✅ Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM) — Free tier: unlimited pushes, 500K/month Firestore | Best free option at scale |
| **Image Uploads** | ✅ Multer + local `/public/uploads/` + Express static serving | Free, unlimited, production-ready. Can migrate to Cloudinary later (free: 25GB) |
| **SMS/WhatsApp/Email** | ✅ Nodemailer (free SMTP via Gmail) + free email notifications | Gmail allows 500 emails/day free. For SMS, integrate 2Factor.in free tier (25 free SMS/day) |

