## 18 Unique Management Systems (One Per Distinct Process)

Each category with a truly distinct business process gets its own management system. Categories with identical processes share a system.

### Management System 1: 🛒 **Retail Product Manager**
**Categories**: Grocery (cat_001), Hardware (cat_015), Clothing (cat_016), Stationery (cat_006), Pet Supplies (cat_008), Pooja Samagri (cat_009), Jewellery (cat_049)

**Unique Process**: `Product Catalog → Inventory → Cart → Order → Pack → Dispatch/Pickup → Deliver`

**Owner Dashboard Features**:
- Product CRUD with variants (size, color, weight), barcode, SKU
- Inventory management with low-stock alerts, reorder level
- OCR Smart List (customer uploads handwritten list → AI maps to products → quote)
- Live online orders feed (real-time via Socket.io)
- In-store POS terminal (barcode scan, quick billing)
- Combo/bundle builder (e.g., "Festival Pack")
- Supplier order management
- Flash sale creator
- Customer directory with purchase history

**Visitor Experience**:
- Product grid with search, filters (dietary, brand, price range)
- Add-to-cart with quantity, variant selection
- Delivery/pickup toggle with time estimate
- Flash sale badges with countdown timer
- "Frequently Bought Together" suggestions
- Reorder from past orders with 1-tap

